OL,3,GNEWSADual carriageway set for phased
OL,4,Amaintenance closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaintenance, including phased road
OL,7,Fclosures, is set to begin on a busy
OL,8,Fdual carriageway.
OL,10,FWork on the A3049 Dorset Way in Poole,
OL,11,Fbetween Holes Bay roundabout and
OL,12,FMannings Heath roundabout, will take
OL,13,Fplace between 5 and 21 September.
OL,15,FRoad closures will be in place on 5 and
OL,16,F6 September between 07:00 BST and 19:00
OL,17,Ffor surface dressing, with overnight
OL,18,Fsweeping works taking place from 7 to
OL,19,F10 September.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
